ive local ticket'","'when it points at an active local ticket' implies the property must be validated against local-ticket liveness, but the plan does not say what happens to the property when the local ticket is gone","AC3 scopes the crash-before-write boundary but is silent on retire/cleanup"],"finding":"AC2 makes the Jira `local_id` entity property a durable identity signal that suppresses inbound adopt and outbound create when it points at an active local ticket, but the plan never defines its RETIRE path: when a local ticket is legitimately deleted/retired, the stale property on the Jira issue could suppress a correct future create (a false no-op). The lifecycle covers create (property written) and consume (suppression) but not cleanup.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f4b6c3d3d36be0836","impact":0.67,"is_primary":null,"location":"AC2 / AC3 / Implementation decision","norm_id":"n36dcdaed6872f85e","priority":0.335,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":[],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Add an AC stating that suppression only fires when the property points at a still-live local ticket, and specify who clears the property (or how liveness is checked) when the local ticket is deleted.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.5,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"no","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"medium","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_witho